{
  "id": "natural_camera_follow",
  "title_zh": "自然跟随运镜",
  "version": 3,
  "scope": "全部",
  "category": "camera",
  "source": "MiniMax-H3 official camera vocabulary + action-legibility heuristic",
  "source_url": "https://github.com/MiniMax-AI/MiniMax-H3/tree/main/skills/h3-prompt-writing",
  "evidence_level": "official_aligned",
  "features": ["tracking", "camera_follow", "action_legibility", "framing"],
  "conflicts": [],
  "semantic_contract": {
    "purpose": "让主镜头根据主体位移自然跟随，以动作可读性而不是炫技为目标。",
    "adds": [
      {"path": "camera.motion.primary", "value": "subject_follow"}
    ],
    "preserves": [
      "continuity.screen_direction",
      "continuity.spatial",
      "subject.action_legibility"
    ],
    "forbids": [
      "unmotivated_camera_whip",
      "continuous_reframing_without_subject_motion",
      "camera_motion_that_obscures_primary_action"
    ],
    "defaults": [
      {"path": "camera.motion.end_state", "value": "settled_composition"}
    ]
  },
  "ownership": {
    "reads": ["subject.motion"],
    "writes": ["camera.motion.primary"],
    "augments": ["continuity.screen_direction"]
  },
  "resolution": {
    "exclusive_group": "camera.motion.primary",
    "priority": 50,
    "requires": [],
    "conflicts": []
  },
  "instructions": "自然跟随运镜规则：先确定主体真实发生的位移，再让一个主要跟随方式服务动作可读性。\n1. 写清主体移动方向、速度、路径和目标；根据动作选择 tracking、truck、pan 或克制的手持跟随之一，不堆叠互相竞争的主运镜。\n2. 镜头可以小幅滞后、重新居中或短暂揭示环境，但每次调整都应由主体运动或叙事信息触发，不能无理由甩动或持续找构图。\n3. 使用前景遮挡、地面参照物与背景视差说明真实位移，同时保持地平线、屏幕方向和人物空间位置连续。\n4. 快速动作只有在可读性确实需要时才增加轻微震动；对白、产品和细节展示应降低幅度。动作结束后落到稳定构图，不在片尾继续漂移。"
}
